## Configuration

### Basic

| Key | Type | Default | Description |
|-----|------|---------|-------------|
| Timeout (`timeout`) | int | 30 | Timeout in seconds |
| Max retries (`max_retries`) | int | 3 | Max retry count |

<details>
<summary>Advanced (4 options)</summary>

| Key | Type | Default | Description |
|-----|------|---------|-------------|
| Concurrency limit (`max_concurrency`) | int | 3 | How many tasks run at once; the rest queue up |
| Notify admin on failure (`notify_admin`) | bool | true | Send admins a notice when processing fails |
| Proxy (`proxy`) | string | empty | Proxy for outbound requests; empty means direct |
| Debug logging (`debug_log`) | bool | false | Print verbose logs; enable only when troubleshooting |

</details>

